  "facts_of_case": "Complainant M/s GIVO Retail Ltd. filed a complaint against respondent Rajesh Rohilla for cheque bounce under Section 138 of the Negotiable Instruments Act, 1881. The complainant was acquitted by the trial court and the appeal is against that order.",
