      "principle": "The burden lies on the complainant to prove that the cheques were not issued under any undue influence.",
      "held": "It is submitted by the complainant that the respondent had been paid his salaries and other dues till 30th September, 2008. However, this court finds that the respondent has established that he was not paid his salaries for the months of August and September, 2008, and LTA/Medical Allowance @ Rs. 6000/- per month for the period running from September 2007 to July 2008 totaling to Rs. 66,000/-.",
